_viewer_test.tgz
docs/figs/_check.png
docs/figs/_r3d.png

# The bare `data/` rule above matches ANY directory named data at any depth,
# which silently swallowed the viewer's frame data and would have published a
# viewer that loads three.js and then fails on data/meta.json. Git cannot
# re-include files under an excluded DIRECTORY, so the directory itself has to
# be un-ignored first, then its contents. 2.1 MB, 124 files, generated by
# scripts/figs/export_viewer.py.
!docs/viewer/data/
!docs/viewer/data/**
paper/arxiv-submission.tar.gz
paper/arxiv/main.pdf
paper/arxiv/*.aux
paper/arxiv/*.log
paper/arxiv/*.out
paper/arxiv/*.brf
